==Route 10==
===Rock Tunnel===
[[File:Rock Tunnel 1F FRLG.png|thumb|Rock Tunnel, 1F]]
[[File:Rock Tunnel B1F FRLG.png|thumb|Rock Tunnel, B1F]]

